desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "kubernetes"
	title: "源码扫描：Kubernetes privileged: true"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Kubernetes privileged: true"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-kubernetes-privileged"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	cwe: "CWE-250"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
privileged: true 让容器接近宿主机权限。

该语言的 struct/ssa 前端还没有接入。当前只保留 source 规则，builtin verify 会跳过 pending-language 目录。

### 风险类型
security-misconfiguration

### 影响
命中说明文件中出现了该危险写法。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配。
### 参考
- CWE-250
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
去掉 privileged，按需添加具体 Linux capability。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pod.yml": <<<POS
securityContext:
  privileged: true

POS
	"safefile://pod-ok.yml": <<<NEG
securityContext:
  privileged: false

NEG
)
${*.yml}.pattern_regex(/privileged:\s*true/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：Kubernetes privileged: true",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Kubernetes privileged: true",
	message: "源码扫描：Kubernetes privileged: true",
	risk: "security-misconfiguration",
}
